        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-781, Modern Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBoring isn't a word that comes to mind while describing this RK International cabinet knob. Sophisticated in design, the Cylinder Cabinet Knob is a great way to add a modern side to any home. The simple lines make it elegant and contemporary in design no matter which of the available finishes you choose; because of this, the Modern Cabinet Pull is one of the few pieces of cabinet hardware that continues to look very \"now\" in finishes that normally date other cabinet pulls such as antique english and oil rubbed bronze. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/pipe-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-880\"><b>Cylinder Cabinet Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/pipe-appliance-pull-rk-international-ap-ph-4880\"><b>Cylinder Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-781 Modern Cylinder Cabinet Hardware:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-781:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 19/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-780:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 1-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 19/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
